  VI. THE HIGHER-DIMENSIONAL ENCODING
  --------------------------------------------------

  The Collatz orbit of n encodes a point in the infinite-dimensional space
  Z_2 x Z_3 x Z_5 x ... (the profinite completion of Z).

  But the DYNAMICS depend only on the 2-adic and 3-adic components:
  - The 2-adic part determines the halving depth (v_2 structure)
  - The 3-adic part tracks how 3n+1 interacts with powers of 3

